# Conformance probe pack: the `json` mirror of the `conformance-long-*` packs
# (spec 0.22). Public. No kinds. Every key and list those packs map, each at a
# member of its own name, so a vector can hand a binary pack any entity and
# read back what one decodes. `hex` text and terminated text are strings.
format     conformance-long-json
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
field   probe.label  label  string
field   probe.tag    tag    string
field   probe.x      x      int
field   probe.y      y      int
field   probe.z      z      int
field   probe.w      w      int
field   probe.a      a      float
group   probe.names  names
  field  probe.tag  .  string
end
group   probe.nums   nums
  field  probe.val  .  int
end
group   probe.recs   recs
  field  probe.y  y  int
end
field   probe.s1     s1     string
